OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Fconditions with showers will continue
OL,7,Fto affect parts of Scotland, northern
OL,8,FEngland and Northern Ireland this
OL,9,Fevening; however, it will become
OL,10,Fsomewhat drier later. Elsewhere, it
OL,11,Fwill turn mostly dry after any evening
OL,12,Fshowers fade, with clear spells
OL,13,Fdeveloping.
OL,14,
OL,15,CMonday:FDry with sunny spells in the
OL,16,Fsouth. Northern areas see a few
OL,17,Fshowers initially, then rain spreads
OL,18,Feast later, this heavy at times on
OL,19,Fwestern hills. Near-normal
OL,20,Ftemperatures, warmest south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
